#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "Quloudの計算事例"
msgstr "Quloud Calculation Examples"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid "材料・分子・気体を対象とした計算の結果と再現手順を探せます。"
msgstr ""
"Find calculation results for materials, molecules, and gases, together "
"with the steps to reproduce them."

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ":doc:`BaTiO3/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`BaTiO3/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid "DFTと機械学習原子間ポテンシャルで、安定な結晶構造と温度による構造相転移を調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses DFT and machine-learning interatomic potentials to study the stable "
"crystal structures and the temperature-driven structural phase "
"transitions."

#: ../../index.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`li3po4/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`li3po4/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:14
msgid "結晶・非晶質の構造、Li空孔の移動障壁、Liイオンの拡散係数を調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Studies crystalline and amorphous structures, migration barriers of Li "
"vacancies, and Li-ion diffusion coefficients."

#: ../../index.rst:16
msgid ":doc:`hydrogen_chain/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`hydrogen_chain/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:18
msgid "Psi4を用い、水素原子を並べたときに軌道のエネルギーがどう変わるかを調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses Psi4 to study how orbital energies change as hydrogen atoms are "
"lined up in a chain."

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`co2_ir/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`co2_ir/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:22
msgid "RSDFTの第一原理分子動力学から、CO₂の振動が赤外スペクトルにどう現れるかを調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses first-principles molecular dynamics with RSDFT to study how the "
"vibrations of CO₂ appear in the infrared spectrum."

#: ../../index.rst:24
msgid ":doc:`kpoints/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`kpoints/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:26
msgid "Quantum ESPRESSOで、金属Cuと半導体Siのk点を増やしたときの物理量の収束を比べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses Quantum ESPRESSO to compare how physical quantities converge as the "
"number of k-points increases for metallic Cu and semiconducting Si."

#: ../../index.rst:28
msgid ":doc:`cu_lattice/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`cu_lattice/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:30
msgid "Quantum ESPRESSOで、エネルギー曲線と応力に基づく構造緩和からCuの格子定数を求めます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses Quantum ESPRESSO to determine the lattice constant of Cu from energy"
" curves and from stress-based structural relaxation."

#: ../../index.rst:32
msgid ":doc:`gan_surface/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`gan_surface/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:34
msgid "Quantum ESPRESSOで候補構造を計算し、条件によって安定な表面構造がどう変わるかを調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses Quantum ESPRESSO to calculate candidate structures and to study how "
"the stable surface structure changes with the conditions."

#: ../../index.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`gas_laws/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`gas_laws/index`"

#: ../../index.rst:38
msgid "GROMACSで希薄気体を計算し、Arの体積と圧力の関係や、気体の種類による違いを調べます。"
msgstr ""
"Uses GROMACS to simulate dilute gases, examine how the volume and "
"pressure of Ar are related, and compare different gas species."

